📌 Step-by-step operation

1️⃣ The Arduino and sensor are powered.

2️⃣ The moisture sensor is inserted into the soil.

3️⃣ The sensor detects the soil moisture condition.

4️⃣ The sensor sends its signal to the Arduino.

5️⃣ Arduino reads the sensor value.

6️⃣ The program compares the reading with the selected threshold.

7️⃣ The output indicates the detected soil condition.

💡 Future improvement

This basic project can be developed into a smart home gardening system by adding a relay, water pump, ESP32/Wi-Fi connectivity, mobile monitoring, notifications, and automatic irrigation.

